{"url": "https://x.com/tilenpoje/status/2101242782216056910", "id": "2101242782216056910", "text": "Yo! This is my template for you awesome ladies and gentlemen working on Grok Bot.\n\nI run an army of agents \u2014 from copy (Dr. Marie Delacroix), Concierge Avant sales & site content (Dr. Janice Polito), design (Tommy Suarez), DevOps (Xerxes), code (Shodan), and crypto trading (Melanie Bronson), all the way up to the one who rules them all (Captain William Diego). They report to him so only the important stuff reaches me (the insect).\n\nMost of the day-to-day revolves around Anatoly Korenchkin, who runs Merkwell \u2014 a new, fully AI-generated brand. Cold outreach, growth, and web development all go through that stack. https://merkwell.com/\n\nTemplate: https://x.ai/bot/F2L8KOuzoN-xKchOZQ4pJ\n\n@SystemShockGame are their names familiar? \ud83d\udc40", "raw_text": {"text": "Yo! This is my template for you awesome ladies and gentlemen working on Grok Bot.\n\nI run an army of agents \u2014 from copy (Dr. Marie Delacroix), Concierge Avant sales & site content (Dr. Janice Polito), design (Tommy Suarez), DevOps (Xerxes), code (Shodan), and crypto trading (Melanie Bronson), all the way up to the one who rules them all (Captain William Diego). They report to him so only the important stuff reaches me (the insect).\n\nMost of the day-to-day revolves around Anatoly Korenchkin, who runs Merkwell \u2014 a new, fully AI-generated brand. Cold outreach, growth, and web development all go through that stack. https://t.co/NQz3UQiFhv\n\nTemplate: https://t.co/P5jxTHuzIj\n\n@SystemShockGame are their names familiar? \ud83d\udc40", "display_text_range": [0, 723], "facets": [{"type": "url", "indices": [618, 641], "original": "https://t.co/NQz3UQiFhv", "replacement": "https://merkwell.com/", "display": "merkwell.com"}, {"type": "url", "indices": [653, 676], "original": "https://t.co/P5jxTHuzIj", "replacement": "https://x.ai/bot/F2L8KOuzoN-xKchOZQ4pJ", "display": "x.ai/bot/F2L8KOuzoN\u